{"ID":"20260915230118-tizojsv","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-tizojsv","title":"LeetCode 2. 两数相加","type":"doc","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-kxd9gzy","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-kxd9gzy","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260915230118-20r6a3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-20r6a3p","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"难度：Medium　标签：递归、链表、数学　链接：https://leetcode.cn/problems/add-two-numbers/"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-elx0x5o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-elx0x5o","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题目"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-p67tl53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-p67tl53","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给你两个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"非空"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的链表，表示两个非负整数：它们是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"逆序"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存的，也就是表头是个位，往后依次是十位、百位……每个结点只存一位数字。"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-icq1vk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-icq1vk2","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"请你把这两个数加起来，用同样「逆序、一位一结点」的形式返回一个新的链表。"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-zcu36ek","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-zcu36ek","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-bg3akqf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-bg3akqf","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-0naeboo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-0naeboo","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个链表结点数在 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[1, 100]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 内"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-e2nkmex","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-e2nkmex","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-ed6llmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-ed6llmg","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0 \u0026lt;= Node.val \u0026lt;= 9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-5mmrg8l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-5mmrg8l","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-5ah3bcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-5ah3bcg","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据保证没有前导零（除了数字 0 本身）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-nox2bly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-nox2bly","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"示例 1：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"l1 = [2,4,3]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"l2 = [5,6,4]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[7,0,8]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（即 342 + 465 = 807）\n示例 2：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"l1 = [0]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"l2 = [0]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[0]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n示例 3：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"l1 = [9,9,9,9,9,9,9]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"l2 = [9,9,9,9]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[8,9,9,9,0,0,0,1]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（这个 9999999 + 9999 最后还多进了一位，别漏）"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-jc1l0f5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-jc1l0f5","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思路"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-el9ghvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-el9ghvu","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一反应：这还不简单？把链表读成一个整数，加起来，再拆回链表不就完了。"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-mkyfpbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-mkyfpbd","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"写完才发现，题目说每个链表最多 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100 个结点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，也就是那个数能有 100 位！​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"long long"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 也就 19 位，直接原地爆炸。所以这题根本不是在考\"怎么把数读出来\"，而是在考"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手写竖式加法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-w0uu8wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-w0uu8wp","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好在它已经是逆序存的，跟竖式从个位开始算的方向"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"完全一致"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以可以一边遍历一边加，根本不用反转链表。"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-wnnz0ko","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-wnnz0ko","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-dt8ho5g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-dt8ho5g","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-arbj9ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-arbj9ye","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 1：进位 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"carry"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。每一位 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sum = a + b + carry"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，本位留 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sum % 10"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，进位更新成 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sum / 10"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-5c9quo8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-5c9quo8","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-e4q4j26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-e4q4j26","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 2：两个链表不一定一样长，短的那个\"缺位\"就当 0。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-tz6vsqn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-tz6vsqn","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-6rhkvlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-6rhkvlg","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 3：循环条件一定要带 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"|| carry != 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，否则最后那一位进位会被丢掉（示例 3 就是靠这个才出结果的）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-hc0fdc4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-hc0fdc4","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-kkplhjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-kkplhjv","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点 4：用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"哨兵头结点"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（dummy head），省掉\"第一个结点要特殊处理\"那堆 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，最后 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"return dummy-\u0026gt;next"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就行。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-z9m6n8f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-z9m6n8f","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-ec5ndss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-ec5ndss","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复杂度：时间 O(max(m, n))，空间 O(max(m, n))（结果链表本身）。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-zzx7uww","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-zzx7uww","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码（C）"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-wvrf70m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-wvrf70m","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法一：读成整数再加（好想，但会溢出）"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-9cyiwqi","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-9cyiwqi","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// LeetCode 2 两数相加\n// 这个思路最顺，可惜只能过小数据：100 位数字 long long 装不下\n// 部分正确，问过 AI：题目最多 100 个结点，得用字符串/竖式思想\nstruct ListNode* addTwoNumbers(struct ListNode* l1, struct ListNode* l2) {\n    long long a = 0, b = 0, unit = 1;\n    for (struct ListNode *p = l1; p; p = p-\u003enext) {   // 逆序存，正好从低位开始乘 1、10、100\n        a += (long long)p-\u003eval * unit;\n        unit *= 10;\n    }\n    unit = 1;\n    for (struct ListNode *p = l2; p; p = p-\u003enext) {\n        b += (long long)p-\u003eval * unit;\n        unit *= 10;\n    }\n    long long sum = a + b;\n    // 把 sum 拆回逆序链表；注意 sum == 0 时要单独处理，不然 head 是空的\n    struct ListNode dummy, *tail = \u0026dummy;\n    dummy.next = NULL;\n    if (sum == 0) {\n        tail-\u003enext = malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode));\n        tail-\u003enext-\u003eval = 0;\n        tail-\u003enext-\u003enext = NULL;\n        return dummy.next;\n    }\n    while (sum \u003e 0) {\n        struct ListNode *node = malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode));\n        node-\u003eval = sum % 10;\n        node-\u003enext = NULL;\n        tail-\u003enext = node;\n        tail = node;\n        sum /= 10;\n    }\n    return dummy.next;\n}\n// 结论：思路对，但 100 位直接溢出，力扣上一堆测试点过不去。老老实实写竖式吧。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-6cwpre6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-6cwpre6","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法二：模拟竖式，边遍历边加（哨兵 + 尾插，O(max(m,n))）"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-qpl1idj","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-qpl1idj","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 哨兵头结点真是个好东西：不用再纠结\"结果的第一个结点谁来做\"，\n// 全程只管往 tail 屁股后面挂新结点就行了\nstruct ListNode* addTwoNumbers(struct ListNode* l1, struct ListNode* l2) {\n    struct ListNode dummy;              // 栈上的哨兵，不会跟着返回，只借用它的 next 指针\n    struct ListNode *tail = \u0026dummy;     // tail 永远指向结果链表的最后一个结点\n    dummy.next = NULL;\n    int carry = 0;                      // 进位，一开始当然是 0\n\n    // 注意第三个条件：两个链表都空了但还有进位，也得再补一个结点（示例 3 的那种情况）\n    while (l1 != NULL || l2 != NULL || carry != 0) {\n        int a = (l1 != NULL) ? l1-\u003eval : 0;   // 短的链表缺位就当 0，不用写两套分支\n        int b = (l2 != NULL) ? l2-\u003eval : 0;\n        int sum = a + b + carry;\n\n        carry = sum / 10;                     // 该进多少位\n        struct ListNode *node = malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode));\n        node-\u003eval = sum % 10;                 // 本位留在链表上的数字\n        node-\u003enext = NULL;\n        tail-\u003enext = node;                    // 尾插\n        tail = node;\n\n        if (l1 != NULL) l1 = l1-\u003enext;        // 判空再走，不然空指针直接寄\n        if (l2 != NULL) l2 = l2-\u003enext;\n    }\n    return dummy.next;   // 千万别 return \u0026dummy，那是个栈变量，函数一退出就废了\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-tqmz06e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-tqmz06e","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法三：递归版（链表题的通解套路）"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-7prbhj2","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-7prbhj2","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 链表题的递归写法永远是最短的，思路就是：\n// \"当前位算好，剩下的交给下一层\"，进位当成参数往下传\nstatic struct ListNode *helper(struct ListNode *l1, struct ListNode *l2, int carry) {\n    // 两个都空、且没有进位了，才真正结束\n    if (l1 == NULL \u0026\u0026 l2 == NULL \u0026\u0026 carry == 0) return NULL;\n\n    int a = (l1 != NULL) ? l1-\u003eval : 0;\n    int b = (l2 != NULL) ? l2-\u003eval : 0;\n    int sum = a + b + carry;\n\n    struct ListNode *node = malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode));\n    node-\u003eval = sum % 10;\n    // 下一层接着算：谁空了就传 NULL，进位接着传\n    node-\u003enext = helper(l1 ? l1-\u003enext : NULL,\n                        l2 ? l2-\u003enext : NULL,\n                        sum / 10);\n    return node;\n}\n\nstruct ListNode* addTwoNumbers(struct ListNode* l1, struct ListNode* l2) {\n    return helper(l1, l2, 0);\n}\n// 递归和迭代复杂度一样，但递归有栈深度（最多 100 层，没事）；\n// 迭代更省心，比赛时我还是更爱写迭代那一版。\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-3gxsi11","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-3gxsi11","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地想自己跑一下"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-a71a67h","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-a71a67h","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 本地调试用的 main，力扣提交时不需要这段\n#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n\nstruct ListNode {\n    int val;\n    struct ListNode *next;\n};\n\n// ===== 解答函数（和解法二一样）=====\nstruct ListNode* addTwoNumbers(struct ListNode* l1, struct ListNode* l2) {\n    struct ListNode dummy;\n    struct ListNode *tail = \u0026dummy;\n    dummy.next = NULL;\n    int carry = 0;\n\n    while (l1 != NULL || l2 != NULL || carry != 0) {\n        int a = (l1 != NULL) ? l1-\u003eval : 0;\n        int b = (l2 != NULL) ? l2-\u003eval : 0;\n        int sum = a + b + carry;\n\n        carry = sum / 10;\n        struct ListNode *node = malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode));\n        node-\u003eval = sum % 10;\n        node-\u003enext = NULL;\n        tail-\u003enext = node;\n        tail = node;\n\n        if (l1 != NULL) l1 = l1-\u003enext;\n        if (l2 != NULL) l2 = l2-\u003enext;\n    }\n    return dummy.next;\n}\n\n// ===== 用数组建链表的辅助函数（逆序，跟题目输入一致）=====\nstruct ListNode *build(int *arr, int n) {\n    struct ListNode dummy, *tail = \u0026dummy;\n    dummy.next = NULL;\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++) {\n        struct ListNode *node = malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode));\n        node-\u003eval = arr[i];\n        node-\u003enext = NULL;\n        tail-\u003enext = node;\n        tail = node;\n    }\n    return dummy.next;\n}\n\nvoid print(struct ListNode *head) {\n    printf(\"[\");\n    for (struct ListNode *p = head; p; p = p-\u003enext) {\n        printf(\"%d%s\", p-\u003eval, p-\u003enext ? \",\" : \"\");\n    }\n    printf(\"]\\n\");\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[] = {2, 4, 3}, b[] = {5, 6, 4};\n    print(addTwoNumbers(build(a, 3), build(b, 3)));    // 期望 [7,0,8]\n\n    int c[] = {0}, d[] = {0};\n    print(addTwoNumbers(build(c, 1), build(d, 1)));    // 期望 [0]\n\n    int e[] = {9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9}, f[] = {9, 9, 9, 9};\n    print(addTwoNumbers(build(e, 7), build(f, 4)));    // 期望 [8,9,9,9,0,0,0,1]\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-y9uzylc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-y9uzylc","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"踩坑与收获"}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-ymc51ja","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-ymc51ja","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-61eehf5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-61eehf5","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-w5tjefp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-w5tjefp","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个坑就是\"想太美\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：一上来就想把链表读成整数，结果题目 100 个结点，直接超出 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"long long"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。以前做 PAT 那种题目输入都是普通整数，没在意过\"位数\"这件事，这次算是被教做人。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-0fw955e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-0fw955e","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-biw267o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-biw267o","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"哨兵头结点（dummy head）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：以前建链表老是要写 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"if (head == NULL) head = node; else tail-\u0026gt;next = node;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，又臭又长。现在挂个哨兵，最后 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"return dummy.next"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，代码短一大截。原来是这样！"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-yjy6rxc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-yjy6rxc","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-nty7zqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-nty7zqe","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"return \u0026amp;dummy"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是个要命的错误"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：dummy 建在栈上，函数一返回就失效了。虽然运行时可能\"看着没错\"，但这是典型的悬空指针。问了下 AI，说要么返回 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dummy.next"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，要么 dummy 就用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"malloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 出来。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-51i6w52","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-51i6w52","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-ghq7bx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-ghq7bx9","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"循环条件的第三个判断"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"|| carry != 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：这个真的容易漏。示例 3 最后多出来一个 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就是它兜住的。以前从没注意过这种\"最后一位还要进位\"的边界。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-j31m0j5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-j31m0j5","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-h8oln55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-h8oln55","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"递归写法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：AI 还告诉我链表题基本都能写成\"处理当前结点 + 递归剩余部分\"的形式，进位这种\"要往下传的状态\"就挂在参数上，想通了之后发现确实好简单！"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915230118-wu369e8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-wu369e8","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915230118-xhjb09u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915230118-xhjb09u","updated":"20260915230118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三种解法对比下来：解法一思路最直觉但会溢出；解法二最稳、比赛首选；解法三最短最优雅。比起刚学链表时在那儿手忙脚乱地 reverse 来 reverse 去，现在竟然这么顺畅，我牛大了。"}]}]}]}]}